      "nodeData": {
        "codeText": "from dataclasses import dataclass\n\n\n@dataclass\nclass ProductResult:\n    \u0022\u0022\u0022Jeden produkt w scenariuszu: cena, koszt jednostkowy, mar\u017Ca pokrycia przed i po zmianie.\u0022\u0022\u0022\n\n    product_id: str\n    name: str\n    price: float\n    unit_cost: float\n    base_unit_cost: float\n    volume: float\n    base_margin_pct: float\n    margin_pct: float\n    contribution: float\n    required_price_increase_pct: float\n\n    AT_RISK_MARGIN_PCT = 5.0\n\n    @property\n    def status(self) -\u003E str:\n        if self.margin_pct \u003C 0:\n            return \u0022strata\u0022\n        if self.margin_pct \u003C self.AT_RISK_MARGIN_PCT:\n            return \u0022zagro\u017Cony\u0022\n        return \u0022OK\u0022\n",
